<section id="screen-dg" class="scr-dg" style="display:block;">

<div class="app">

  <div class="topbar">
    <div>
      <div class="eyebrow">SYS 611 &middot; Diagram Builder</div>
      <h1>Build a production-ready process</h1>
      <p class="subtitle">Reconstruct the tic-tac-toe turn as an activity diagram, then run it through stress tests. Your diagram doesn't need to match anyone else's exactly, it just has to survive every scenario. Drag from the small dots on each block's edge to connect it. Click a connection line to remove it.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="row">
      <span class="badge" id="dg_connBadge">0 connections</span>
      <button id="dg_answerButton" class="btn ghost" type="button">Instructor answer</button>
